flowchart LR
	INVIS["Files that never passed through a write tool<br/>are invisible to every normalization layer DSH has."]
	RAW["raw-write's normalize: true - an explicit per-call<br/>opt-in for NEW writes"]
	STREAM["The six stream flavors only rewrite model output<br/>never touching disk"]
	KEEP["A pre-existing file keeps every typographic character<br/>it was born with - exactly the characters that break<br/>parsers - shells - diffs and byte-exact edit matches<br/>downstream."]
	INVIS --> RAW
	INVIS --> STREAM
	INVIS --> KEEP
